  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Threads of woven silver thread through the leather, glowing with a faint, ancient light. To fasten it is to feel a surge of tireless vitality and a mastery over the unseen forces of the world. Few such artifacts remain that can anchor such vast power to a single mortal frame."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Leather of a deep, weathered brown shows many stitch-marks where old buckles were replaced. The belt remains supple despite its age, cinching firmly around the waist with a sturdy, dependable grip."
    }
  },
